[2026-03-14T22:51:32.915Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ju225gFD3mZrFoH2KR6PK","type":"tool_result","content":"937:**Components**: IssueHeader, IssueDescription, SubIssues, ActivityComments, IssueSidebar\n988:### IssueDescription\n990:#### Test: Description renders markdown content\n994:#### Test: Description shows placeholder when empty\n1008:#### Test: Description supports markdown formatting\n1232:- **Expected**: Modal displays: Team selector dropdown, Title text input, Description text area, Status dropdown, Priority dropdown, Assignee searchable selector, Labels multi-select, Project searchable selector, Cycle dropdown, Due date picker, and Parent issue searchable selector. All fields are visible and properly labeled.\n1263:#### Test: Description field supports markdown text entry\n1265:- **Action**: User types \"## Overview\\nThis issue covers the auth flow\" in the Description text area\n1266:- **Expected**: The Description field accepts and displays the markdown text.\n1397:- **Initial state**: Create issue modal is open. User has filled in: Title \"Implement OAuth\", Description \"Add OAuth support\", Status \"Todo\", Priority \"High\", Assignee \"Alice Smith\", Labels \"Feature\", Project \"API Redesign\", Cycle \"Sprint 10\", Due date \"Mar 25, 2026\".\n1751:- **Expected**: The modal displays the following fields: Name (text input, required), Description (text area), Status (dropdown), Lead (searchable member selector), Target date (date picker), Teams (multi-select). \"Create Project\" and \"Cancel\" buttons are visible at the bottom.\n1775:- **Action**: User enters \"New Feature\" in Name, \"Build the new feature\" in Description, selects \"In Progress\" status, selects \"Alice\" as lead, picks target date \"2026-05-01\", selects teams \"Engineering\" and \"Design\", clicks \"Create Project\"\n1806:- **Expected**: All fields are reset to their defaults (Name is empty, Description is empty, Status is default, Lead is unset, Target date is unset, Teams is unset). No data from the previous creation persists in the form.\n1918:#### Test: Clicking Overview tab switches to overview content\n2008:#### Test: Overview tab renders description, milestones, and key metrics sections\n2010:- **Expected**: The overview displays three sections: a \"Description\" section showing the project description text, a \"Milestones\" section listing milestones, and a \"Key Metrics\" section showing project statistics.\n2012:#### Test: Description is inline editable\n2013:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description is \"Rewrite the authentication system\".\n2018:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description field is in edit mode.\n2022:#### Test: Description supports markdown rendering\n2023:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description contains markdown: \"## Goals\\n- Support OAuth\\n- Support SSO\\n\\n**Priority**: High\".\n2027:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description is \"Original description\".\n2031:#### Test: Description shows placeholder when empty\n2032:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has no description.\n2035:#### Test: Milestones section displays existing milestones\n2036:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has milestones: \"Alpha Release\" (target date Mar 15, 2026, completed) and \"Beta Release\" (target date Apr 1, 2026, not completed).\n2040:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestones section is visible.\n2045:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Add milestone form is visible.\n2050:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Add milestone form is visible with \"Draft\" entered.\n2055:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" is not completed.",