[2026-03-14T22:52:18.191Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DFQhGDydZwEmHZBwoNLoNs","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report.\n\n## Exploration Report: Linear-Clone App\n\n### 1. App Directory Structure\n\nThe LinearClone app is located at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/` with the following key directories:\n\n- **`src/`** - Main React application source\n  - `App.tsx` - Root component with routing and authentication\n  - `components/` - React components (ProjectOverviewTab, ProjectHeader, ProjectIssuesTab, etc.)\n  - `pages/` - Page components (ProjectDetail, Projects, Members, Teams, etc.)\n  - `slices/` - Redux slice files for state management\n  - `store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n  - `index.css`, `main.tsx` - Entry point styling and React DOM mount\n\n- **`netlify/functions/`** - Serverless functions (26 functions total)\n  - Key functions: `project-detail.ts`, `project-milestones.ts`, `update-project.ts`\n\n- **`scripts/`** - Build and deployment scripts\n  - `seed-db.ts` - Database seeding\n  - `test.ts`, `check.ts`, `deploy.ts`\n\n- **`tests/`** - Playwright e2e test specs (40+ test files)\n\n- **`docs/`** - Documentation\n  - `tests.md` - Comprehensive test specification\n\n### 2. Test Specification File: docs/tests.md\n\nThe test spec at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` is a 2100+ line comprehensive document. Key sections related to your request:\n\n#### **ProjectOverviewTab Section (Lines 2006-2104)**\n\nThe Overview tab section documents these major features:\n\n**Overview Tab - Description:**\n- Test 2008-2010: Renders description, milestones, and key metrics sections\n- Test 2012-2015: Description is inline editable (clicking enables edit mode)\n- Test 2017-2020: Edit and save description (persists to DB, creates activity entry)\n- Test 2022-2024: Description supports markdown rendering (headings, bold, lists)\n- Test 2026-2029: Cancel description edit reverts changes (ESC key)\n- Test 2031-2033: Description shows placeholder \"Add a description...\" when empty\n\n**Milestones Section:**\n- Test 2035-2037: Display existing milestones with target dates and completion status\n- Test 2039-2042: Add new milestone (form with name and target date fields)\n- Test 2044-2047: Save new milestone (persists, creates activity entry)\n- Test 2049-2052: Cancel adding milestone\n- Test 2054-2057: Toggle milestone completion status\n- Test 2059-2062: Toggle milestone back to incomplete\n- Test 2064-2072: Delete milestone with confirmation dialog\n- Test 2079-2087: Edit milestone name and target date inline\n- Test 2089-2091: Empty state when no milestones\n\n**Key Metrics Section:**\n- Test 2093-2095: Display project statistics (total issues, completed, in-progress, remaining, completion %)\n- Test 2097-2100: Key metrics update when issue statuses change\n- Test 2102-2104: Handle project with zero issues (show 0% or N/A)\n\n### 3. Project Overview Tab Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectOverviewTab.tsx` (385 lines)\n\nThis is the core component implementing the Overview tab. Key features:\n\n**State Management:**\n- `editingDesc` - Whether description is in edit mode\n- `descValue` - Description text value\n- `showAddMilestone` - Shows/hides milestone add form\n- `editingMilestoneId` - Tracks which milestone is being edited\n- `deletingMilestoneId` - Tracks milestone pending deletion\n\n**Key Functions:**\n- `formatDate()` - Formats dates as \"Mar 15, 2026\"\n- `simpleMarkdown()` - Parses markdown (headings #/##, bold **, italic *, lists)\n- Description handlers: `handleDescClick()`, `saveDescription()`, `handleDescKeyDown()`\n- Milestone handlers: `handleAddMilestone()`, `handleToggleMilestoneComplete()`, `startEditMilestone()`, `saveEditMilestone()`, `confirmDeleteMilestone()`\n\n**Key Metrics Calculation:**\n```typescript\nconst totalIssues = project.totalIssues;\nconst completedIssues = project.completedIssues;\nconst inProgressIssues = project.inProgressIssues;\nconst remainingIssues = totalIssues - completedIssues;\nconst completionPercentage = totalIssues > 0 ? Math.round((completedIssues / totalIssues) * 100) : 0;\n```\n\n**Data-testid Attributes:** All major elements have data-testid attributes for testing:\n- `project-overview-tab`\n- `project-overview-description-section`\n- `project-overview-milestones-section`\n- `project-overview-metrics-section`\n- `project-overview-milestone-*` (various milestone operations)\n\n### 4. ProjectDetail Page Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx` (73 lines)\n\nOrchestrates the project detail page:\n- Uses `useParams` to get `projectId` from URL\n- Manages `activeTab` state ('issues' or 'overview')\n- Dispatches `fetchProjectDetail(projectId)` on mount\n- Renders `ProjectHeader` and either `ProjectIssuesTab` or `ProjectOverviewTab`\n- Shows loading/error states\n\n### 5. Existing Test Files\n\n**Test files related to projects:** \n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/project-header.spec.ts` - 15K\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/project-issues-tab.spec.ts` - 15K\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/project-issues-bulk.spec.ts` - 14K\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/projects-create-modal.spec.ts` - 20K\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/project-card.spec.ts` - 12K\n\n**Test Structure Pattern:**\n```typescript\nasync function loginViaApi(baseURL: string) { ... }\nasync function getProjectsData(baseURL: string, token: string) { ... }\nasync function getProjectDetail(baseURL: string, token: string, projectId: string) { ... }\nasync function loginAndGoToProject(page, baseURL, projectId) { ... }\n\ntest.describe('Project [Feature]', () => {\n  test('test name', async ({ page, baseURL }) => { ... });\n});\n```\n\n### 6. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts` (24 lines)\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000ms per test\n- expect.timeout: 10000ms\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: true (no skipping tests in CI)\n- retries: 0\n- reporters: replayReporter, json, html\n- baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- actionTimeout: 15000ms\n- Uses Replay Chromium for debugging recordings\n```\n\n### 7. Database Seed File\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (198 lines)\n\nCreates seed data:\n- **Workspace:** \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Members:** Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith (member), Carol Davis (member)\n- **Teams:** Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- **Labels:** Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n- **Project:** \"V2 Launch\" with description \"Version 2.0 product launch with new features\"\n- **Milestones:** \"API Complete\" (Apr 15, 2026), \"Beta Launch\" (May 30, 2026)\n- **Issues:** 8 Engineering issues + 3 Design issues with various statuses/priorities\n- **Cycle:** \"Sprint 12\" (Mar 10-24, 2026)\n- **Notifications:** Sample notifications for testing\n\n### 8. Netlify Functions Related to Projects\n\n**project-detail.ts** - GET endpoint (`/api/project-detail?projectId=`)\n- Fetches full project details including:\n  - Project info (name, description, status, target date, lead)\n  - Project issues with team grouping\n  - Issue counts (total, completed, in-progress)\n  - Milestones\n  - Members\n  - Labels\n  - Project activity\n\n**project-milestones.ts** - POST/PUT/DELETE endpoints (`/api/project-milestones`)\n- POST: Create new milestone\n  - Body: `{projectId, name, targetDate}`\n  - Returns milestone with id, name, targetDate, completed status\n  - Creates project activity entry\n- PUT: Update milestone\n  - Supports updating: name, targetDate, completed status\n  - Can update any combination of fields\n  - Creates appropriate activity entries\n- DELETE: Delete milestone\n  - Query params: `milestoneId`, `projectId`\n  - Creates activity entry for deletion\n\n**update-project.ts** - PUT endpoint (`/api/update-project`)\n- Updates project fields: name, status, description, targetDate, leadId\n- Creates activity entries with descriptive action messages\n- Returns updated project with fresh issue counts and latest activity\n\nAll functions require Bearer token authentication and return appropriate status codes.\n\n### 9. Package.json Scripts Section\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/package.json`\n\n```json\n\"scripts\": {\n  \"dev\": \"vite\",                    // Dev server\n  \"build\": \"tsc -b && vite build\",  // TypeScript build + Vite build\n  \"lint\": \"eslint .\",               // ESLint linting\n  \"preview\": \"vite preview\",        // Preview production build\n  \"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\",  // Custom check script\n  \"test\": \"tsx scripts/test.ts\",    // Run tests via custom script\n  \"deploy\": \"tsx scripts/deploy.ts\" // Deployment script\n}\n```\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- React 19.2, React DOM 19.2\n- React Redux 9.2, Redux Toolkit 2.11\n- React Router DOM 7.6\n- Neon Database (serverless)\n\n**Dev Dependencies:**\n- Playwright 1.52 with Replay.io integration\n- TypeScript 5.9\n- Vite 7.3\n- ESLint with React hooks plugin\n- Netlify CLI and Functions SDK\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThe linear-clone app is a full-stack project management tool (Linear.com clone) with:\n\n1. **Frontend:** React 19 + Redux for state, React Router for navigation\n2. **Backend:** Netlify serverless functions with Neon PostgreSQL\n3. **Testing:** Playwright e2e tests with Replay.io recordings\n4. **Key Features:** Projects with tabs (Issues/Overview), Milestones with CRUD, inline description editing with markdown support, key metrics (issue counts/percentages)\n\nThe ProjectOverviewTab component is highly functional with all required tests documented in docs/tests.md, fully supporting descriptions, milestones management, and key metrics display as specified in the test requirements."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ab1848be82f943ee8 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<u